							8450.635
						],
						"pointId": 9445
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750240822,
					"content": "After being defeated, the Tepetlisaurus named \"Marigold\" drills into the ground and hides only who-knows-where. You take the chance to check on the injured person...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240801
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240801,
					"content": "No obvious wounds... Hey, are you alright? Can you hear Paimon?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240802,
					"content": "...Hmm? Marigold? Ah, you gentle soul. You're concerned about me, aren't you? Worry not. I've been training myself to play with you without any worries...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Icayo"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240803,
					"content": "#Hey, Paimon's Paimon, y'hear? Not some Marigold! {NICKNAME}, do you think he might have hurt his head in the fall?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240804,
						750240805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240804,
					"content": "With any luck, his head will clear up soon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240806,
					"content": "Wait. You're not Marigold. What's going on? What happened to me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Icayo"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240807,
					"content": "You tell him of how he was surrounded by the three Saurians and knocked down by Marigold...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240808
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240808,
					"content": "Ah, so that's what happened. Sorry for the trouble. The name's Icayo. As you can see, I'm an adventurer who loves chasing Saurians... and who sometimes winds up being chased by them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Icayo"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240809,
					"content": "I had a spell of ill-health that resulted in my being bedridden for a while. Not only did my stamina decline greatly during that time, but I wasn't able to meet them on the regular either...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Icayo"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240810,
					"content": "To have been surrounded by them even before making it to camp... Ah, how fortunate I am, to be one so fretted over.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240811,
						750240812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Icayo"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240811,
					"content": "You're a real positive thinker.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240813,
					"content": "Anyway, we had a bit of a... tussle with Marigold in our rush to save you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240814,
					"content": "Ah, nothing to worry about. I imagine that was no different from any other game to her. She's probably off sulking somewhere over the loss.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Icayo"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240815,
					"content": "Despite appearances, she's got a delicate soul. I'll go comfort her later, so again, don't you worry.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Icayo"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240816,
					"content": "Alright then. Looks like you're fine. Guess we worried for nothing, but Paimon's glad you're okay all the same.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240817,
					"content": "And I'm grateful for that. Ah, yes. While this isn't of much value... Please, take this Sour Sauce Ceviche recipe of mine, would you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Icayo"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240818,
					"content": "#Ripple loves this dish — maybe your companion, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, might too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Icayo"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240819,
					"content": "Roooah... Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240820,
					"content": "#Hmm? Wanna give it a try, eh? No need to worry, {NICKNAME} will make some for you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240821,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240812,
					"content": "Is that how it is...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240805,
					"content": "That would be a problem...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240806
					]
				}
			]
		},
